( https://albiononline.com/news/living-legacy )

Adventurer,

Albion Online is turning five! And to mark this momentous occasion, today s=
ees the beginning of a unique, two-week event: *Living Legacy*.

Until maintenance on *July 28* , we=E2=80=99re celebrating Albion=E2=80=99s=
 history and your part in it with some special *themed vanity items* , *bir=
thday cake* , *city decorations* , and =E2=80=93 above all else =E2=80=93 s=
ome *familiar faces* roaming through the open world=E2=80=A6
For a taste of what=E2=80=99s out there, check out this brand-new video:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DpwTNtdvemgs )

Albion=E2=80=99s Past Comes to Life
---------------------------

After much speculation as to their whereabouts, the missing statues from Co=
nquerors=E2=80=99 Hall have been discovered =E2=80=93 and *they=E2=80=99re =
alive* ! These monuments to Albion=E2=80=99s triumphant guilds can be encou=
ntered in any *Tier 5 or higher zone* , and carry vast riches with them. Bu=
t they=E2=80=99re not friendly towards adventurers, and will fight with fea=
rsome weapons and spells before they give up their loot.

The living statues exist in *three different sizes* , which vary in strengt=
h, rarity, and value. So the stronger the statue you or your party can defe=
at, the better the chance of claiming some unique anniversary rewards. Arm =
up and take down these idols!

( https://albiononline.com/changelog/living-legacy )

Unique Gifts and Rewards
------------------------

For the duration of the event an array of *unique rewards* will be availabl=
e to players, like a *Fifth Anniversary Avatar* and *Avatar Ring,* a themed=
 *Riding Horse skin* , a firework-launching *Chromacannon* , an *Anniversar=
y Banner* , and slices of cake which grant a *temporary Fame boost* - as lo=
ng as you eat them before the event is over!

Albion=E2=80=99s history is the history of its players, so join us for this=
 unique celebration. Check out the full event patchnotes here, and go make =
some history of your own:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/changelog/living-legacy )

